	dcterms:description "Pd-catalyzed aminocarbonylation of iodobenzene with aniline as the nucleophile (in toluene, triethylamine base) to form benzanilide, over Pd3P/SiO2. 3 runs at 100, 120, and 140 C (5 h, CO 10 bar); yield/conversion increased with temperature from 10% to 78%." ;
